{50}{Very well.  The ring.  The man you seek is Gilbert Bates.  There is nothing else I can tell you.  And the dead call me back, traveler...I must return.  Fare thee well...}{Very well.  The ring.  The man you seek is Gilbert Bates.  There is nothing else I can tell you.  And the dead call me back, traveler...I must return.  Fare thee well...}{}{}{}{gf1022 1, ss 2, qu1011 4, ru 2038}
