{290}{We found old Jack, in his cabin, with two daggers in him...one for each eye...and the sign' o the evil eye carved into his chest.  The very sign Old Stringy Pete used to leave on his victims.  We ran out to see who was on the other boat, but it was gone, a'takin' the clouds and the westerly with it.}{We found old Jack, in his cabin, with two daggers in him...one for each eye...and the sign' o the evil eye carved into his chest.  The very sign Old Stringy Pete used to leave on his victims.  We ran out to see who was on the other boat, but it was gone, a'takin' the clouds and the westerly with it.}{}{}{}{gf1027 1}
