{1509}{He felt himself betrayed when the Council condemned his actions. He showed no remorse. In his arrogance, he was sure he would be vindicated. I cast the deciding vote to banish my own son. "If I must die, I will be the last!' He screamed, as he hurled the spell that brought an end to the Council, the Age of Legends, and my will to live.}{He felt himself betrayed when the Council condemned his actions. He showed no remorse. In his arrogance, he was sure he would be vindicated. I cast the deciding vote to banish my own son. "If I must die, I will be the last!' He screamed, as he hurled the spell that brought an end to the Council, the Age of Legends, and my will to live.}{}{110}{}{ }
