{1513}{As the battle came to a close, only myself, two council members, and Arronax remained standing. With all of his allies either dead or dying, we began the banishment spell...}{As the battle came to a close, only myself, two council members, and Arronax remained standing. With all of his allies either dead or dying, we began the banishment spell...}{}{112}{}{ }
{1514}{[More]}{}{1}{}{1515}{ }
{1515}{In the end, it was only through our combined might that Arronax was subdued, and I watched my own son fall into the horror of the Void.  But such was the fury and power unleashed by this conflict that the very fabric of reality was torn asunder.}{In the end, it was only through our combined might that Arronax was subdued, and I watched my own son fall into the horror of the Void.  But such was the fury and power unleashed by this conflict that the very fabric of reality was torn asunder.}{}{113}{}{ }
